Third-party material
--------------------
* catalog/catalog.json — model and parameter tables derived from lpedit-lib by Nicolas Schwartz
  (https://github.com/StarAurryon/lpedit-lib), LGPL-3.0. Converted and extended by tools/gen-catalog.py.
  Its protocol research (POD HD500X) was the starting point of this project.
* Electron, node-usb (usb), puppeteer-core and their dependencies — see their respective licenses.

* app/public/js/gear.js, catalog/gear-styles.json — original vector illustrations of amps, cabs, microphones and pedals, drawn from real-world gear archetypes; no Line 6 artwork is used.

* catalog/amp-origins.json — which real-world amplifier each POD HD500 amp model is based on, transcribed from Line 6's published model list (names are trademarks of their owners).
* catalog/fx-origins.json — which real-world pedal or rack unit each effect model is based on, transcribed from Line 6's published "POD HD Model Gallery" (names are trademarks of their owners; see DISCLAIMER.md).
* app/public/fonts — Inter (SIL OFL 1.1), used where Apple's SF Pro is not installed.
